B.XH=new A.b5(B.bl,["Wanjiku Mwangi","Nairobi, Kenya","SORA made finding my dream home in Nairobi effortless! Their agents were incredibly helpful and knew the market inside out. Highly recommend to anyone looking for a property in Kenya."],t.l)
B.XS=new A.b5(B.bl,["James Ouma","Kisumu, Kenya","Selling our family land through SORA was a breeze. The process was transparent, and we got a fantastic offer much faster than we expected. They are the most trusted realtors in Kenya!"],t.l)
B.XP=new A.b5(B.bl,["Fatuma Ahmed","Mombasa, Kenya","As a first-time land buyer, I was overwhelmed. SORA's patient team and clear process made the journey enjoyable and stress-free. I'm so happy with my plot in the coastal area!"],t.l)
B.XQ=new A.b5(B.bl,["David Githinji","Kiambu, Kenya","The property listings on SORA are incredibly detailed and accurate. I found exactly what I was looking for, from a gated community to a bungalow in Kiambu, without any hassle. A truly professional service."],t.l)
B.XW=new A.b5(B.bl,["Akinyi Odhiambo","Nakuru, Kenya","SORA's local guides provided invaluable insights into the neighbourhoods we were considering. It helped us make a truly informed decision on our investment property. Excellent service!"],t.l)
B.XJ=new A.b5(B.bl,["Peter Kamau","Eldoret, Kenya","I've used several real estate platforms, but SORA stands out with their commitment to excellence and genuine care for their clients. A seamless experience from start to finish."],t.l)
B.XK=new A.b5(B.bl,["Grace Wanjiru","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","We found the perfect townhouse on Mirema Drive through SORA. The location is excellent, and the team ensured a smooth transition. The best real estate agents for properties along Thika Road!"],t.l)
B.XR=new A.b5(B.bl,["Mwangi wa Macharia","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","SORA's deep knowledge of Mirema Drive properties was a game-changer. They showed us listings that perfectly fit our family's needs and budget. We love our new home!"],t.l)
B.XX=new A.b5(B.bl,["Emily Muringo","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","The process of acquiring our new commercial space on Mirema Drive was handled with pure professionalism. SORA is the go-to for anyone seeking property in this bustling area."],t.l)
B.XM=new A.b5(B.bl,["Linet Chege","Westlands, Nairobi","SORA helped us find and furnish the perfect Airbnb apartment in Westlands. Their insights into the short-term rental market are unmatched. Our bookings are through the roof!"],t.l)
B.XY=new A.b5(B.bl,["Sammy Okoth","Kilimani, Nairobi","Investing in an Airbnb unit in Kilimani was a great decision, and it wouldn't have been possible without SORA. They handled everything from identifying the property to tenant management. A top real estate company in Kenya for sure."],t.l)
B.XT=new A.b5(B.bl,["Chebet Kiprono","Nakuru, Kenya","We were looking for a high-yield rental property in Nakuru. SORA delivered a gem! The team is responsive, and their property management services are fantastic. Thank you for helping us grow our portfolio."],t.l)
B.XU=new A.b5(B.bl,["Victor Njoroge","Kilimani, Nairobi","I was looking for a modern Airbnb apartment for a short stay. SORA's listings were detailed and the booking process was seamless. The property was exactly as described. So happy with my experience!"],t.l)
B.XL=new A.b5(B.bl,["Monica Moraa","Lavington, Nairobi","The team at SORA truly understands the Airbnb market. They helped me find a property with high rental potential in a prime area like Lavington. My investment is already paying off."],t.l)
B.XV=new A.b5(B.bl,["Joseph Rotich","Karen, Nairobi","SORA's professional guidance on investing in a luxurious Airbnb villa in Karen was invaluable. They provided all the financial projections and made the entire process transparent and secure."],t.l)
B.XI=new A.b5(B.bl,["Mercy Adhiambo","Mombasa, Kenya","Our search for a perfect beachfront Airbnb was tough, but SORA made it happen. Their knowledge of the coastal real estate market is incredible. We found a place that our guests adore."],t.l)
B.XO=new A.b5(B.bl,["Daniel Ochieng","Upper Hill, Nairobi","SORA helped us manage our rental properties efficiently. They are a reliable partner and their team ensures that our properties are always occupied. Top-notch property management in Kenya."],t.l)
